chapter AFP

session Classical_Variable_Freeness = Grounding_Classical_Common +
  description \<open>The variable-freeness stage: instantiates every reachable operator into a nullary
    (variable-free) action schema via a term.CONST lift, promoting objects to constants and keeping
    predicates, functions, numeric preconditions/effects and init/goal verbatim. Well-formedness-
    and plan-preserving. The numeric pipeline emits its output directly; the propositional/STRIPS
    grounder builds on it as its first stage.\<close>
  options [timeout = 900]
  theories
    Classical_Variable_Freeness
    Classical_Variable_Freeness_Semantics
    Classical_Variable_Freeness_Num_Free
